 "おちぐち": "[crest (of a waterfall)] / فَم, بق (The front opening of a creature through which food is ingested.)  [mouth (of a sewer, etc.)] / [spout (e.g. of a watering can)] / [start of a fall]\norig. meaning",
 "おちこち": "بُعْد ((countable, uncountable) amount of space between points) / مَسَافَة ((countable, uncountable) amount of space between points) / بَعَّدَ (Often followed by from.)  [distance]\nمثال: 遠近感がとぼしいのです。\n→ I'm afraid my depth perception is very poor.",
