 "おちこぼれる": "تَأَخَّرَ (To be late (for a regular event))  [to fall behind]\nمثال: クリスは理科の授業で落ちこぼれそうです。\n→ Chris risks falling behind in the science class. / قَطْرَة (small quantity of liquid, just large enough to hold its own ) / نُقْطَة (small quantity of liquid, just large enough to hold its own ) / أَسْقَطَ (to let (something) fall; to allow (something) to fall (eithe)  [to drop]",
