 "おてつき": "[touching a wrong card (in karuta) ; buzzing too early (in a quiz)] / سَيِّدَة (A woman, specifically one with great control, authority or ownership.) / خَلِيلَة, عَشِيقَة (The other woman in an extramarital relationship, generally including sexual rela)  [mistress (who is one's servant)] / مُخَالَفَة (A foul ball, a ball which has been hit outside of the base lines.)  [foul (comp. karuta)]",
 "おてつだい": "خَادِمَة, خَدامَة (An adult or adolescent female servant or cleaner (short for maidservant). (In fe)  [maid]\nمثال: 今日ではお手伝いさんを雇う余裕のある人は少ない。\n→ Nowadays few people can afford to employ a maid. / مُسَاعَدَة, مَعُونَة (Action given to provide assistance; aid.) / مُسَاعِد, مُسَاعِدَة (Something or someone which provides assistance with a task.) / سَاعَدَ, عَاوَنَ (To provide assistance to (someone or something).) / مُسَاعَدَة, النَّجْدَة (A cry of distress or an urgent request for assistance.)  [help]\nمثال: 恐縮ですがお手伝い願えませんか。\n→ May I make so bold as to request your assistance?",
