 "おてまえ": "[tea-ceremony procedures ; skill at serving tea] / مَهَارَة (A capacity to do something well; a technique, an ability, usually acquired or le)  [skill] / مَن, اَلْمَرْء (Anyone, one; an unspecified individual or group of individuals (as subject or ob) / ـكُم, ـكُنَّ (A dummy pronoun used in certain constructions, usually with verbs of receiving ()  [you]\nused mainly between samurai of equal rank",
