 "おてんとさま": "شَمْس, شمس (The star that is closest to the Earth.) / شَمْس, شمس (A star, especially when seen as the centre of any single solar system.)  [the sun] / بروفيدنس (capital city of Rhode Island, United States of America)  [providence]",
