 "おでかけ": "[about to start out ; just about to leave or go out]\noft. used as a greeting in the form of お出かけですか？\nمثال: いつお出かけになりますか。\n→ When will you go out? / خَارِج (From the inside to the outside of; out of.)  [outing]",
 "おでき": "دُمَّل, خُرَاج (A localized accumulation of pus in the skin, resulting from infection.) / غَلَيَان, غَلْي (The point at which fluid begins to change to a vapour; the boiling point.) / غَلَّى (To cook in boiling water.)  [boil]",
