 "おとす": "قَطْرَة (small quantity of liquid, just large enough to hold its own ) / نُقْطَة (small quantity of liquid, just large enough to hold its own ) / أَسْقَطَ (to let (something) fall; to allow (something) to fall (eithe)  [to drop]\nمثال: 彼は花瓶を落とした。\n→ He dropped a vase. / نَقَلَ (to take away) / أَزَالَ (to take away) / أَخْرَجَ (to take away) / جَذَبَ (to take away)  [to remove (e.g. stains or facial hair)]\nمثال: トニーはシャツを脱いで、それでピアノのよごれを落としました。\n→ Tony took off his shirt and cleaned the piano with it. / فَقَدَ (To cease to have (something) in one's possession or capability.) / خَسِرَ (To become a defeated competitor in (a game, competition, trial, etc).) / خَسِرَ (To be defeated (in a game, competition, contest, etc.))  [to lose (a match)]\nمثال: 昨年彼は期末の２科目を落とした。\n→ Last year, he failed two of his final examinations. / أَدْنَى, دُنْيَا (Bottom; more towards the bottom than the middle of an object.) / أَنْزَلَ (To let descend by its own weight, as something suspended; to let down.)  [to lower (e.g. shoulders or voice)]\nمثال: そのスキャンダルが彼の評判を落とした。\n→ The scandal detracted from his reputation.",
