 "おはなし": "قِصَّة, حِكَايَة (An account of real or fictional events.)  [story]\nمثال: 知っていることしかお話しできません。\n→ I can only tell you what I know. / تَكَلَّمَ, تَحَدَّثَ (To communicate, usually by means of speech.) / مُحَاضَرَة (A lecture.) / خِطَاب (A major topic of social discussion.) / مُحَادَثَات, مُفَاوَضَات (Meeting to discuss a particular matter.)  [talk]",
