 "おばけ": "شَبَح, خَيَال (A disembodied soul; a soul or spirit of a deceased person; a spirit appearing af)  [ghost]\nمثال: 私の家におばけが出たのは本当だ。\n→ It's true that a ghost appeared at my house. / وَحْش (terrifying dangerous creature)  [monster] / [something unusually large]",
