 "おみごと": "بْرَافُو, بِرَافُو (Used to express acclaim, especially to a performer.)  [bravo]\nمثال: 「お見事、よくやった」と小川選手を褒め称える報道が多かった。\n→ There were many journalists who praised Ogawa with, \"bravo, good show!\"",
