 "おみせする": "ثَبَتَ, وَضَحَ (To display, convey or exhibit; to have something available for others to see; to) / عَرْض, اِسْتِعْرَاض (A play, dance, or other entertainment.) / بَرْنَامَج (A broadcast program, especially a light entertainment program.) / مَعْرِض (An agricultural exhibition.) / إِظْهَار, عَرْض (A demonstration.)  [to show]\nمثال: 私のアルバムをあなたにお見せします。\n→ I'll show my album to you.",
 "おみつもり": "اِقْتِبَاس, اِسْتِشْهَاد (A statement attributed to a person; a quotation.) / عَلَامَة اِقْتِبَاس, عَلَامَة تَنْصِيص (A quotation mark.) / سَعَر (A summary of work to be done with a set price; a quotation.) / سِعْرُ ٱلْأَسْهُم (A price set and offered (by the potential seller) for a financial security or co) / اِسْتَشْهَدَ, اِقْتَبَسَ (To indicate verbally or by equivalent means the start of a quotation.)  [quote]",
 "おみな": "اِمْرَأَة (adult female person)  [woman]",
 "おみまい": "زَارَ (To go and meet (a person) as an act of friendliness or sociability.) / زِيَارَة (A single act of visiting.)  [visit (to someone affected by illness or misfortune)]\nمثال: 彼女のお見舞いに行こうよ。\n→ Why don't we go and see her in the hospital? / هَدِيَّة, هدية (Something given to another voluntarily, without charge.) / قَرِيحَة (A talent or natural ability.) / أَهْدَى (To give as a gift or donation.)  [gift (in token of one's sympathy)] / اِتِّفَاقِيَّة (An agreement between parties; an arrangement.)  [dealing (a hit)]",
