 "おむかえ": "اِسْتَقْبَلَ, اِسْتَلَمَ (To take, as something that is offered; to accept.) / اِسْتَقْبَلَ, يَسْتَقْبِل (To act as a host for guests; to give admittance to; to permit to enter, as into )  [receiving] / [final call ; call of fate]",
