 "おめにかかる": "لَاقَى, لَقِيَ (To make contact (with someone) while in proximity.) / اِلْتَقَى, تَقَابَلَ (To make contact (with someone) while in proximity.) / تَعَرَّفَ (To make contact (with someone) while in proximity.)  [to meet (someone of higher status)]\nمثال: 家内もお目にかかることを楽しみにしておりますから。\n→ My wife will be glad to see you, too. / [to be recognized (esp. by someone of higher status) ; to be visible]",
