 "おも": "شَيْخ, قَائِد (The leader or head of a tribe, organisation, business unit, or other group.)  [chief]\nمثال: 読書が彼のおもな楽しみだ。\n→ Reading is his chief amusement. / [main secondary or supporting role (in kyogen)]\nusu. written as オモ",
 "おもい": "ثَقِيل (having great weight)  [heavy]\nمثال: 体積が大きいからといって常に重量も重いとは限らない。\n→ Great bulk does not always mean great weight. / ثَقِيل (having great weight)  [heavy (feeling)]\nمثال: 前途に苦難があるという思いで彼の心は重かった。\n→ A sense of trouble ahead oppressed his spirits. / بَطِيء (Taking a long time to move or go a short distance, or to perform an action; not ) / أَبْطَأَ, بَطَّأَ (To make (something) run, move, etc. less quickly; to reduce the speed of.)  [slow] / مُهِمّ (Having relevant and crucial value; having import.)  [important (position, responsibility, etc.)]\nمثال: 私はそんな重い責任を引き受けたくない。\n→ I don't like to take on such heavy responsibilities.",
 "おもいあがり": "غَطْرَسَة (Excessive arrogance or pride, or presumption; originally (Greek mythology) towar)  [hubris]",
 "おもいあたる": "ٱسْتَدْعى (To call back, bring back, or summon (someone) to a specific place, station, etc.) / تَذَكَّرَ (To call back (a situation, event, etc.) to one's mind; to remember; to recollect) / سَحْبٌ (The action or fact of calling someone or something back.)  [to recall (in a flash)]\nمثال: 夏休みも近いけど、どこかいいところ思い当たりますか。\n→ Summer vacation is near. Can you think of a good place for the holidays?",
 "おもいあわせる": "اِعْتَبَرَ, تَدَبَّرَ (To think about seriously.) / عَدَّ (To assign some quality to.)  [to consider (all the circumstances)]",
