 "おもいいれ": "[emotional attachment] / مَوْقِف, سُلُوك (A disposition or state of mind.)  [attitude (expressing emotion)]",
 "おもいうかべる": "تَذَكَّرَ (To recall from one's memory; to have an image in one's memory.) / اِسْتَذْكَرَ (To memorize; to put something into memory.)  [to remember]\nمثال: 家族のことを思い浮かべるといえが恋しくなる。\n→ I feel homesick when I remember my family. / تَخَيَّلَ, تَصَوَّرَ (To form a mental image of something; to envision or create something in one's mi)  [to imagine]\nمثال: 彼はその詩を読んでアルカデイアを心の中に思い浮かべた。\n→ He conjured up Arcadia reading the poem.",
