 "お揃い": "[being together ; going together] / مُبَارَاة (Any contest or trial of strength or skill, or to determine superiority.) / شَحّاطَة, شَخَّاطَة (Synonym of fuse, a long wick used to transfer flame to an explosive device.)  [matching (clothing)]",
 "お断り": "رَفَضَ (To choose not to do something; refuse, forbear, refrain.)  [declining]\nمثال: 返品お断り。\n→ No merchandise can be returned. / إِعْلَان, بَلَاغ (That which conveys what is announced.)  [announcement]",
 "お断わり": "رَفَضَ (To choose not to do something; refuse, forbear, refrain.)  [declining]\nمثال: 返品お断り。\n→ No merchandise can be returned. / إِعْلَان, بَلَاغ (That which conveys what is announced.)  [announcement]",
