 "お方": "رَبَّة, رَبَّةْ اَلْبَيْت (The mistress of a household.) / خَاتُون, سَيِّدَة (A woman of breeding or higher class, a woman of authority.) / لِيدِي (A title for someone married to a lord or gentleman.)  [lady]",
 "お日様": "شَمْس, شمس (The star that is closest to the Earth.) / شَمْس, شمس (A star, especially when seen as the centre of any single solar system.)  [the Sun]\nمثال: お日様が明るく輝いています。\n→ The sun is shining brightly.",
 "お早う": "صَبَاح الْخَيْر, صَبَاح النُّور (Used as a greeting when meeting someone for the first time in the morning.)  [good morning]\nused at any time of the day in some industries and workplaces\nمثال: おはよう。ご飯をよそっても良いかしら？\n→ Morning. Shall I dish up?",
 "お早うございます": "صَبَاح الْخَيْر, صَبَاح النُّور (Used as a greeting when meeting someone for the first time in the morning.)  [good morning]\nused at any time of the day in some industries and workplaces\nمثال: 皆さん、おはようございます。\n→ Good morning, everyone.",
