 "お昼": "غَدَاء (A light meal usually eaten around midday, notably when not as main meal of the d)  [lunch]\nمثال: お昼をおごってくれたのを覚えてますか。\n→ Do you remember buying me lunch? / ظهر, ظَهِيرَة (The time of day when the Sun seems to reach its highest point in the sky; solar )  [noon]\nمثال: お昼までには戻ってきなさい。\n→ You are supposed to be back by noon. / نَهَارُ (The time of daylight; the time between sunrise and sunset.)  [daytime] / نَهَضَ, اِرْتَفْعَ (To move, or appear to move, physically upwards relative to the ground.) / أَشْرَقَ, شَرَقَ (To move, or appear to move, physically upwards relative to the ground.)  [rising]",
 "お時間": "وَقْت (A duration of time.) / مَرَّة, مرة (An instant of time.) / وَقْت (An instant of time.) / حِين, وَقْت (A ratio of comparison (see also usage notes and prepositional sense at 'times').)  [(your) time]\nusu. in a request",
