 "お暇": "تَرَكَ (To have a consequence or remnant.) / تَرَكَ, غَادَرَ (To depart; to separate from.) / إِجَازَة, عُطْلَة (Permission to be absent; time away from one's work.)  [leaving]\nمثال: 「もうおいとまします」と彼は出し抜けに言った。\n→ \"Now I must say good-bye,\" he said suddenly. / [leaving one's employment ; quitting one's job]",
