 "お花畑": "حَدِيقَة أَزْهَار (A garden where flowers are grown for decorative purposes.)  [flower garden] / [field of alpine flowers] / خَيَال (That which comes from one's imagination or the act of imagining things.) / فَنْتَازِيَا (The literary genre generally dealing with themes of magic and the supernatural, )  [fantasy]",
 "お茶": "شَاي, فِنْجَان شَاي (Any drink which is similar to Camellia sinensis tea in some way:) / فِنْجَان شَاي (A cup of any of these drinks, often with milk, sugar, lemon, or tapioca pearls.)  [tea (esp. green or barley)]\nمثال: ご都合のよいときにお茶を飲みにお寄りになりませんか。\n→ Why don't you drop in for tea at your convenience? / اِسْتِرَاحَة (A short break or rest period during the day when a cup of tea or coffee is drunk)  [tea break]\nمثال: ３時はお茶にしよう。\n→ Let's have tea at 3:00. / سَادُو, طُقُوس اَلشَّاي (A detailed ritual in Japan for preparing, serving and drinking green tea, seen a)  [tea ceremony]",
