 "お蔭様で": "لِحُسْن اَلْحَظّ (it is fortunate that)  [fortunately]\nمثال: おかげさまで助かりました。\n→ Thank you very much for your help. / [thanks to your (his, their, everyone's, etc.) kindness ; thanks to your assistance]",
