 "お見せする": "ثَبَتَ, وَضَحَ (To display, convey or exhibit; to have something available for others to see; to) / عَرْض, اِسْتِعْرَاض (A play, dance, or other entertainment.) / بَرْنَامَج (A broadcast program, especially a light entertainment program.) / مَعْرِض (An agricultural exhibition.) / إِظْهَار, عَرْض (A demonstration.)  [to show]\nمثال: 私のアルバムをあなたにお見せします。\n→ I'll show my album to you.",
