 "お馴染み": "مَأْلُوف (Known to one, or generally known; commonplace.)  [familiar]\nمثال: その物語はおなじみである。\n→ The tale is familiar to us. / عَادِيّ (Having a constant pattern; showing evenness of form or appearance.) / مُنْتَظِمٌ (Both equilateral and equiangular; having all sides of the same length, and all () / عَادِيّ (Having the expected characteristics or appearances; normal, ordinary, standard.)  [(a) regular]",
