 "かい": "اِجْتِمَاع, مَجْلِس (A gathering of persons for a purpose; an assembly.) / مُلَاقَاة, مُقَابَلَة (An encounter between people, even accidental.) / مُلَاقَاة, لِقَاء (An administrative unit in the Religious Society of Friends (Quakers).)  [meeting]\nمثال: この会に出席している他の代表者に直接話すのではなく、どうか議長に話して下さい。\n→ Kindly address yourself to the chairman, not directly to other representatives at this meeting. / مُجْتَمَع, جَمَاعَة (A long-standing group of people sharing cultural aspects such as language, dress) / جَمْعِيَّة (A group of people who meet from time to time to engage in a common interest; an ) / اِجْتِمَاعِيَّة (The people of one’s country or community taken as a whole.)  [society]\nمثال: この会の名称はＥ．Ｓ．Ｓ．とする。\n→ This association shall be called the E.S.S.",
