 "かいい": "سِرّ (Something secret or unexplainable; an unknown.) / غُمُوض (Someone or something with an obscure or puzzling nature.)  [mystery] / شَبَح, خَيَال (A disembodied soul; a soul or spirit of a deceased person; a spirit appearing af)  [ghost]",
 "かいいき": "مِيَاه (A body of water, almost always a river, sometimes a lake or reservoir, especiall) / سَقَى (To wet or supply with water; to moisten; to overflow with water; to irrigate.) / أَسْقَى, سَقَى (To wet or supply with water; to moisten; to overflow with water; to irrigate.)  [waters]\nمثال: この海域を航行するのはとても気持ちがいい。\n→ It is very pleasant to sail these waters.",
 "かいいれ": "شِرَاء, اِشْتِرَاء (The act of making a purchase.)  [buying]",
