 "かがし": "فَزَّاعَة (An effigy, typically made of straw and dressed in old clothes, fixed to a pole i)  [scarecrow] / دُمْيَة (Something constructed with the size and form of a human, to be used in place of )  [dummy]",
 "かがふり": "تَرْتِيب, نِظَام (Arrangement, disposition, or sequence.) / أَمْر, حُكْم (A command.) / طَلَب (A request for some product or service; a commission to purchase, sell, or supply) / جَمَاعَة (A group of religious adherents, especially monks or nuns, set apart within their) / وِسَام (A decoration, awarded by a government, a dynastic house, or a religious body to ) / رُتْبَة (A category in the classification of organisms, ranking below class and above fam) / أَمَرَ (To issue a command to; to charge.) / طَلَبَ, حَجَزَ (To request some product or service; to secure by placing an order.)  [order]",
 "かがまる": "قَوْس, قوس (A weapon made of a curved piece of wood or other flexible material whose ends ar) / اَنْشُوطَة, فيونكة (A type of knot with two loops, used to tie together two cords such as shoelaces ) / اِنْحَنَى (To play music on (a stringed) instrument using a bow.) / اِنْحَنَى لِلتَّحِيَّة, اِنْحَنَى (To bend oneself as a gesture of respect or deference.) / اِنْحِنَاءَة, اِلْتِوَاءَة (A gesture, usually showing respect, made by inclining the head or bending forwar) / قَيْدُوم (The front of a boat or ship.)  [to bow (of one's back, e.g. due to age)]",
 "かがみ": "مِرْآة, مراية (A smooth surface, usually made of glass with reflective material painted on the )  [mirror]\nمثال: 海は鏡のようになめらかだった。\n→ The sea was as smooth as glass. / [barrel head] / [page added at the beginning of a document mentioning its purpose, date, author, etc.] / [mirror-shaped mochi]",
 "かがみいた": "لَجْنَة, لَجْنَة تَحْكِيم (A group of people gathered to judge, interview, discuss etc. as on a television )  [panel] / [painted backdrop (panel at the back of a noh stage), on which a pine tree is painted]\nsymbolically a reflection of tree at the front of the stage",
 "かがむ": "[to stoop ; to lean over]\nمثال: 彼は靴をはくためにかがんだ。\n→ He stooped to put on his shoes. / صَغِير وَثَخِين (Relatively short or low, and thick or broad.) / قُرْفُصَاء (A position assumed by bending deeply at the knees while resting on one's feet.) / قُرْفُصَاء (Any of various modes of callisthenic exercises performed by moving the body and ) / جَثَمَ (To bend deeply at the knees while resting on one's feet.)  [to squat]\nمثال: 彼はかがんでボールを拾った。\n→ He bent down and picked up the ball.",
