 "かがやく": "لَمَعَ, وَمَضَ (To emit or reflect light so as to glow.)  [to shine]\nمثال: 空には太陽が輝いています。\n→ The sun is shining in the sky. / خَشَبَة (Any large piece of timber or iron long in proportion to its thickness, and prepa) / كَمَرَة, جَائِز (One of the principal horizontal structural members, usually of steel, timber, or) / شُعَاع (A ray; a gleam.)  [to beam]",
 "かがやくばかり": "مُشِعّ, مُتَوَهِّج (Radiating light and/or heat.)  [radiant]",
 "かがり": "مَجْمَرَة, مَنْقَل (An upright standing or hanging metal bowl used for holding burning coal for a so)  [brazier] / مَشْعَل (A large, controlled outdoor fire lit to celebrate something or as a signal.)  [bonfire]",
 "かがりび": "مَشْعَل (A large, controlled outdoor fire lit to celebrate something or as a signal.)  [bonfire] / [brothel-keeper (Edo period)]",
