 "かきあつめる": "مِدَمَّة, مُشْط (A garden tool with a row of pointed teeth fixed to a long handle, used for colle) / يجمع الحشائش (to act upon with a rake, or as if with a rake) / قذائف مكثفَة (to act upon with a rake, or as if with a rake) / يسرح الشعر\\الحشائش (to act upon with a rake, or as if with a rake)  [to rake]\nمثال: その子供はおもちゃをかき集めた。\n→ He gathered his toys together.",
 "かきあらためる": "يتكيف مع (To make oneself comfortable to a new thing.)  [to adapt (e.g. a novel)]\nمثال: この小説を子供向きに書き改めるのは難しい。\n→ It is hard to adapt this story for children.",
