 "かきいれ": "إِدْخَال (The act of entering.) / وُلُوج, نَفَاذ (Permission to enter.) / مَدْخَل, دُخُول (A doorway that provides a means of entering a building.) / مَدْخَل, مُدْخَل (An item in a list, such as an article in a dictionary or encyclopedia.) / دَفْتَر, مَدْخَل (A record made in a log, diary or anything similarly organized; (computing) a dat)  [entry]",
 "かきうつす": "نُسْخَة (result of copying) / اِنْتَسَخَ, نَسَخَ (To produce an object identical to a given object.)  [to copy (down)]\nمثال: この書類を書き写すとき一語もおとすことのないように気をつけなさい。\n→ In copying this paper, be careful not to leave out any words.",
