 "かきたす": "جَمَعَ (To sum up; to put together mentally; to add up.) / أَضَافَ (To append (e.g. a statement); to say further information.) / أَضَافَ (To intensify; to augment; to increase.) / أَضَافَ (To add someone as a friend.)  [to add (a paragraph, more lines, etc.)]",
 "かきたてる": "تَفْصِيل, تَفَاصِيل (A part small enough to escape casual notice.) / فَصَّلَ (To explain in detail.)  [to detail]\nمثال: 新聞はその事件を盛んに書き立てた。\n→ The newspapers devoted a lot of space to the affair.",
