 "かきだす": "[to begin to write ; to start writing]\nمثال: １ます空けて書き出しなさい。\n→ Begin to write, leaving one space blank. / [to write out (e.g. on a blackboard)] / مُقْتَطَف (A portion of a book, document, recording etc. incorporated distinctly in another) / خلاصة (A decoction, solution, or infusion made by drawing out from any substance that w)  [to extract (and write down)] / صَادِرَات (Something that is exported.) / تَصْدِير (The act of exporting.) / صَدَّرَ (To sell (goods) to a foreign country.)  [to export]",
