 "かきつけ": "وَرَق, قِرْطَاس (A sheet material typically used for writing on or printing on (or as a non-water) / وَرَقَة (A written document, generally shorter than a book; usually written as a school a) / وَرَقَة (A written document that reports scientific or academic research and is usually s) / وَرَقِيّ (Made of paper.)  [paper] / لَائِحَة (A draft of a law, presented to a legislature for enactment; a proposed or projec) / فَاتُورَة, حِسَاب (A written note of goods sold, services rendered, or work done, with the price or) / مِنْقَار (The beak of a bird, especially when small or flattish; sometimes also used with )  [bill]",
