 "かきね": "وَشِيع, سِيَاج نَبَاتِيّ (A thicket of bushes or other shrubbery, especially one planted as a fence betwee)  [hedge]\nمثال: よい垣根はよい隣人をつくる。\n→ Good fences make good neighbors. / حَدّ, حُدُود (The line or frontier area separating political or geographical regions.) / حَدّ, حُدُود (The outer edge of something.)  [border]",
