 "かくれ": "مُخْفًى, خَفِيّ (Located or positioned out of sight; not visually apparent.)  [hidden]\nمثال: このような名詞句を隠れ疑問文（concealed　question）といいます。\n→ This type of noun phrase is called a \"concealed question\". / مَوْت (cessation of life) / وَفَاة (cessation of life) / هَلَاك (cessation of life) / مَنِيَّة (cessation of life) / حِمَام (cessation of life) / موت (cessation of life)  [death]",
