 "かけら": "قِطْعَة, شَقَفَة (A part broken off; a small, detached portion; an imperfect part, either physical)  [fragment]\nمثال: 彼らはパンのかけらを置くことによって道に迷わなかった。\n→ Putting pieces of bread prevented them from getting lost. / أُوقِيَّة (28.3495 g) / وِقِيَّة (28.3495 g) / أَوْنْس (28.3495 g) / أونصة (28.3495 g) / أونسة (28.3495 g)  [ounce (of truth, conscience, etc.)]\nمثال: 彼は勇気のかけらもなかった。\n→ He didn't have a grain of courage.",
 "かける": "عَلَّقَ (To put up to hang.) / أَغْلَقَ الْخَطّ (To terminate a telephone call, originally by hanging the receiver on its hook or)  [to hang up (e.g. a coat, a picture on the wall)]\nمثال: コートをハンガーに掛けておきなさい。\n→ Put your coat on a hanger. / لَبِسَ, اِرْتَدَى (To don (clothing, equipment, or the like).)  [to put on (e.g. a blanket)]\nمثال: ウエートレスはテーブルの上に白いテーブルクロスをかけた。\n→ The waitress spread a white cloth over the table. / لَبِسَ, اِرْتَدَى (To don (clothing, equipment, or the like).)  [to put on (glasses, etc.)]\nمثال: その婦人は真珠のネックレスをかけていた。\n→ The lady wore a necklace of pearls. / فَعَلَ, صَنَعَ (To create.) / جَعَلَ (To cause to be.) / جَعَلَ (To force to do.) / جَعَلَ (To indicate or suggest to be.)  [to make (a call)]\nمثال: １０円で電話がかけられますか。\n→ Can I make a phone call for ten yen?",
 "かけ合せる": "ضَرَبَ (To perform multiplication on (a number).)  [to multiply] / صَلِيب (A geometrical figure consisting of two straight lines or bars intersecting each ) / صَلِيب (A wooden post with a perpendicular beam attached and used (especially in the Rom) / صَلِيب (Alternative letter-case form of Cross (“the Crucifix, the cross on which Christ ) / عَبْر, خِلَال (The cross product of the previous vector and the following vector.) / عَبَرَ (To move relatively.)  [to cross] / خَلَطَ, مَزَجَ (To stir together.)  [to mix (e.g. paint colours)]",
 "かけ合わす": "ضَرَبَ (To perform multiplication on (a number).)  [to multiply] / صَلِيب (A geometrical figure consisting of two straight lines or bars intersecting each ) / صَلِيب (A wooden post with a perpendicular beam attached and used (especially in the Rom) / صَلِيب (Alternative letter-case form of Cross (“the Crucifix, the cross on which Christ ) / عَبْر, خِلَال (The cross product of the previous vector and the following vector.) / عَبَرَ (To move relatively.)  [to cross]",
 "かけ合わせる": "ضَرَبَ (To perform multiplication on (a number).)  [to multiply] / صَلِيب (A geometrical figure consisting of two straight lines or bars intersecting each ) / صَلِيب (A wooden post with a perpendicular beam attached and used (especially in the Rom) / صَلِيب (Alternative letter-case form of Cross (“the Crucifix, the cross on which Christ ) / عَبْر, خِلَال (The cross product of the previous vector and the following vector.) / عَبَرَ (To move relatively.)  [to cross] / خَلَطَ, مَزَجَ (To stir together.)  [to mix (e.g. paint colours)]",
 "かけ声": "صَيح, صِيَاح (A loud burst of voice or voices; a violent and sudden outcry, especially that of) / صَرَخَ, صَاحَ (To utter a sudden and loud cry, as in joy, triumph, exultation or anger, or to a)  [shout (of encouragement, etc.)]",
 "かけ心地": "رَاحَة (Contentment, ease.) / جابر (A consolation; something relieving suffering or worry.) / وَاسَى, عَزَّى (To relieve the distress or suffering of; to provide comfort to.)  [comfort (of glasses, a chair, etc.)]",
 "かけ橋": "[temporary (suspension) bridge ; makeshift bridge] / جِسْر (construction or natural feature that spans a divide) / قَنْطَرَة (construction or natural feature that spans a divide) / كوبري (construction or natural feature that spans a divide) / جسر (construction or natural feature that spans a divide) / قنطرة (construction or natural feature that spans a divide) / جسر (construction or natural feature that spans a divide) / بْرِيدْج (Any of a certain family of trick-taking card games.)  [bridge (between cultures, generations, etc.)] / [walkway (constructed on a cliff face) ; plank path]",
 "かけ算": "ضَرْب (A calculation involving multiplication.) / ضَرْب (The process of multiplying or increasing in number; increase.)  [multiplication]\nمثال: 子供たちは掛け算を暗記している。\n→ The children are learning the multiplication tables by heart.",
 "かけ違い": "[putting (up) in the wrong place ; hanging in the wrong place] / صِرَاع, نِزَاع (A clash or disagreement, often violent, between two or more opposing groups or i)  [conflict] / [crossing paths without meeting ; missing each other]",
 "かけ違う": "[to put (up) in the wrong place ; to hang in the wrong place] / اِخْتَلَفَ (Not to have the same traits or characteristics; to be unalike or distinct.)  [to differ (e.g. of opinions)] / [to miss (meeting) each other ; to pass each other by]",
 "かげ": "ظِلّ, خَيَال (A dark image projected onto a surface where light (or other radiation) is blocke)  [shadow]\nمثال: その少女は自分の影におびえていた。\n→ The girl was afraid of her own shadow. / اِنْعِكَاس, عَكْس (The act of reflecting or the state of being reflected.)  [reflection]\nمثال: 水たまりに映った影が見えた。\n→ Reflections could be seen in the puddles. / [ominous sign] / إِشَارَة مُرُور, إِشَارَة ضَوْئِيَّة (A source of illumination.) / نُور, ضَوْء (A flame or something used to create fire.) / أَشْعَلَ, أَوْقَدَ (To start (a fire).) / أَضَاءَ (To illuminate; to provide light for when it is dark.) / مُنِير (Having light; bright; clear; not dark or obscure.) / فَاتِح (Pale or whitish in color; highly luminous and more or less deficient in chroma.) / خَفِيف (of low weight) / خفيف (of low weight) / خفيف (of low weight)  [light (stars, moon)]",
 "かげうら": "ظِلّ, مَظَلَّة (Darkness where light, particularly sunlight, is blocked.)  [shade]",
 "かげえ": "خَيَال, سَوَاد (An artistic depiction, often of a person's profile, in the form of an outline wi)  [silhouette]",
 "かげがさす": "ظَهَرَ (To come or be in sight; to be in view; to become visible.) / ظَهَرَ, بَدَا (To seem; to have a certain semblance; to look.)  [to appear] / مِنْسَج (A frame or machine of wood or other material, in which a weaver forms cloth out )  [to loom (of a threat, etc.)]"
